  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>&nbsp;be a set with exactly <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;elements and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi></math>&nbsp;be a set with exactly <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;elements. If <math><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is the number of one-one functions from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Y</mi></math> and <math><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is the number of onto functions from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>X</mi></math>, then the value of <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is _____-.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "119",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br ><math><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br ><math><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo></math> Number of one-one function <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></math><br ><math><mi>β</mi><mo>→</mo></math> Number of onto function Y to X<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/posqcetnvugxkkjgrjmbvthrbwhctnnjlqdhseyzhvrlmfqpcb.png\"/><br >So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>7</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mi> </mi><mn>7</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></math><br ><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>119</mn></math>",
